{"lineas": [{"speaker": "Robert", "start": 0, "end": 8.48, "text": "You know, people ask me about success all the time, and honestly, I think we've been sold a very convenient little story about it.", "words": [{"w": "You", "s": 0, "e": 0.24}, {"w": "know,", "s": 0.24, "e": 0.72}, {"w": "people", "s": 0.8, "e": 1.28}, {"w": "ask", "s": 1.28, "e": 1.6}, {"w": "me", "s": 1.6, "e": 1.76}, {"w": "about", "s": 1.76, "e": 2}, {"w": "success", "s": 2, "e": 2.4}, {"w": "all", "s": 2.4, "e": 2.64}, {"w": "the", "s": 2.64, "e": 2.8}, {"w": "time,", "s": 2.8, "e": 3.04}, {"w": "and", "s": 3.04, "e": 3.36}, {"w": "honestly,", "s": 3.36, "e": 3.84}, {"w": "I", "s": 3.84, "e": 4.08}, {"w": "think", "s": 4.08, "e": 4.64}, {"w": "we've", "s": 4.64, "e": 5.12}, {"w": "been", "s": 5.12, "e": 5.2}, {"w": "sold", "s": 5.2, "e": 5.68}, {"w": "a", "s": 5.68, "e": 6.08}, {"w": "very", "s": 6.08, "e": 6.4}, {"w": "convenient", "s": 6.4, "e": 6.96}, {"w": "little", "s": 6.96, "e": 7.36}, {"w": "story", "s": 7.36, "e": 7.68}, {"w": "about", "s": 7.68, "e": 8}, {"w": "it.", "s": 8, "e": 8.48}]}, {"speaker": "Zendaya", "start": 8.72, "end": 16.565, "text": "Okay, I need to hear this, because every time someone explains success to me, it sounds like a poster in a gym, and real life has never once worked that way.", "words": [{"w": "Okay,", "s": 8.72, "e": 9.28}, {"w": "I", "s": 9.28, "e": 9.36}, {"w": "need", "s": 9.36, "e": 9.52}, {"w": "to", "s": 9.52, "e": 9.6}, {"w": "hear", "s": 9.6, "e": 9.84}, {"w": "this,", "s": 9.84, "e": 10}, {"w": "because", "s": 10, "e": 10.24}, {"w": "every", "s": 10.24, "e": 10.48}, {"w": "time", "s": 10.48, "e": 10.64}, {"w": "someone", "s": 10.64, "e": 10.96}, {"w": "explains", "s": 10.96, "e": 11.36}, {"w": "success", "s": 11.36, "e": 11.76}, {"w": "to", "s": 11.76, "e": 11.92}, {"w": "me,", "s": 11.92, "e": 12.4}, {"w": "it", "s": 12.4, "e": 12.48}, {"w": "sounds", "s": 12.48, "e": 12.8}, {"w": "like", "s": 12.8, "e": 12.96}, {"w": "a", "s": 12.96, "e": 13.12}, {"w": "poster", "s": 13.12, "e": 13.44}, {"w": "in", "s": 13.44, "e": 13.6}, {"w": "a", "s": 13.6, "e": 13.68}, {"w": "gym,", "s": 13.68, "e": 14}, {"w": "and", "s": 14.165, "e": 14.325}, {"w": "real", "s": 14.325, "e": 14.645}, {"w": "life", "s": 14.645, "e": 14.885}, {"w": "has", "s": 14.885, "e": 15.045}, {"w": "never", "s": 15.045, "e": 15.285}, {"w": "once", "s": 15.285, "e": 15.605}, {"w": "worked", "s": 15.605, "e": 15.845}, {"w": "that", "s": 15.845, "e": 16.085}, {"w": "way.", "s": 16.085, "e": 16.565}]}, {"speaker": "Robert", "start": 16.565, "end": 27.285, "text": "Exactly. The story says, work hard, stay positive, and the universe pays you back. But nobody mentions the part where your starting line matters, enormously.", "words": [{"w": "Exactly.", "s": 16.565, "e": 17.525}, {"w": "The", "s": 17.525, "e": 17.765}, {"w": "story", "s": 17.765, "e": 18.165}, {"w": "says,", "s": 18.165, "e": 18.485}, {"w": "work", "s": 18.485, "e": 18.965}, {"w": "hard,", "s": 18.965, "e": 19.605}, {"w": "stay", "s": 19.605, "e": 19.925}, {"w": "positive,", "s": 19.925, "e": 20.405}, {"w": "and", "s": 20.405, "e": 20.725}, {"w": "the", "s": 20.725, "e": 20.885}, {"w": "universe", "s": 20.885, "e": 21.285}, {"w": "pays", "s": 21.285, "e": 21.605}, {"w": "you", "s": 21.605, "e": 21.765}, {"w": "back.", "s": 21.765, "e": 22.325}, {"w": "But", "s": 22.725, "e": 22.885}, {"w": "nobody", "s": 22.885, "e": 23.365}, {"w": "mentions", "s": 23.365, "e": 23.925}, {"w": "the", "s": 23.925, "e": 24.165}, {"w": "part", "s": 24.165, "e": 24.405}, {"w": "where", "s": 24.405, "e": 24.725}, {"w": "your", "s": 24.725, "e": 25.125}, {"w": "starting", "s": 25.125, "e": 25.525}, {"w": "line", "s": 25.525, "e": 25.845}, {"w": "matters,", "s": 25.845, "e": 26.485}, {"w": "enormously.", "s": 26.485, "e": 27.285}]}, {"speaker": "Zendaya", "start": 27.88, "end": 36.04, "text": "Right, because where you come from changes everything. The city you grew up in, the money in the house, even the way people talked about failure at your dinner table.", "words": [{"w": "Right,", "s": 27.88, "e": 28.28}, {"w": "because", "s": 28.28, "e": 28.44}, {"w": "where", "s": 28.44, "e": 28.76}, {"w": "you", "s": 28.76, "e": 28.92}, {"w": "come", "s": 28.92, "e": 29.08}, {"w": "from", "s": 29.08, "e": 29.24}, {"w": "changes", "s": 29.24, "e": 29.72}, {"w": "everything.", "s": 29.72, "e": 30.44}, {"w": "The", "s": 30.76, "e": 30.92}, {"w": "city", "s": 30.92, "e": 31.16}, {"w": "you", "s": 31.16, "e": 31.32}, {"w": "grew", "s": 31.32, "e": 31.48}, {"w": "up", "s": 31.48, "e": 31.64}, {"w": "in,", "s": 31.64, "e": 31.96}, {"w": "the", "s": 31.96, "e": 32.04}, {"w": "money", "s": 32.04, "e": 32.28}, {"w": "in", "s": 32.28, "e": 32.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 32.44, "e": 32.52}, {"w": "house,", "s": 32.52, "e": 33.08}, {"w": "even", "s": 33.16, "e": 33.4}, {"w": "the", "s": 33.4, "e": 33.56}, {"w": "way", "s": 33.56, "e": 33.72}, {"w": "people", "s": 33.72, "e": 33.96}, {"w": "talked", "s": 33.96, "e": 34.28}, {"w": "about", "s": 34.28, "e": 34.44}, {"w": "failure", "s": 34.44, "e": 34.84}, {"w": "at", "s": 34.84, "e": 35.08}, {"w": "your", "s": 35.08, "e": 35.24}, {"w": "dinner", "s": 35.24, "e": 35.48}, {"w": "table.", "s": 35.48, "e": 36.04}]}, {"speaker": "Robert", "start": 36.04, "end": 47.345, "text": "That last one is huge. If failure meant shame in your family, you learn to hide. If it meant information, you learn to adjust. Same talent, completely different lives.", "words": [{"w": "That", "s": 36.04, "e": 36.52}, {"w": "last", "s": 36.52, "e": 36.84}, {"w": "one", "s": 36.84, "e": 37}, {"w": "is", "s": 37, "e": 37.24}, {"w": "huge.", "s": 37.24, "e": 37.8}, {"w": "If", "s": 38.12, "e": 38.36}, {"w": "failure", "s": 38.36, "e": 38.76}, {"w": "meant", "s": 38.76, "e": 39.16}, {"w": "shame", "s": 39.16, "e": 39.4}, {"w": "in", "s": 39.4, "e": 39.64}, {"w": "your", "s": 39.64, "e": 39.8}, {"w": "family,", "s": 39.8, "e": 40.28}, {"w": "you", "s": 40.28, "e": 40.36}, {"w": "learn", "s"